  "title": "Lizzo Says Her Upcoming Album 'Special' Is A Classic Project With Really Thought Out Songs",
  "htmlContent": "<!-- wp:image {\"id\":515632,\"width\":662,\"height\":662,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img src=\"http://landonbuford.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/05/17lizzo-item-mediumSquareAt3X-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-515632\" width=\"662\" height=\"662\"/><figcaption>Associated Press</figcaption></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/lizzobeeating/\">Lizzo</a> took Instagram to bare it all while dancing to her hit song 'About Damn Time' in a viral dance challenge that definitely did numbers that it went number one on TikTok user Jae Rae, whom the Truth Hurts' artist shouted her out in her caption.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.instagram.com/p/CdJ2tvtvfid/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\",\"type\":\"rich\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"instagram\",\"responsive\":true} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-rich is-provider-instagram wp-block-embed-instagram\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.instagram.com/p/CdJ2tvtvfid/?utm_source=ig_web_copy_link\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>“I told y’all I got the song of the summer— we the #1 song on TikTok— I'm posting everyone who does this dance.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>About Damn Time is off of Lizzo's upcoming album 'Special' dropping on July15, which she recently confirmed with <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/shaydiddy/\">Shay Diddy</a> of <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/106kmel\">106.1 KMEL</a>. She also shared that it is mixed, mastered, and ready to go. When asked if there would be any guest features,<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJgk84lFfXM\"> Lizzo said</a>, \"These are all great questions; I love these questions. Tracklist coming soon!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>She was later asked what the album means to her and why she called it 'Special.'</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:embed {\"url\":\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJgk84lFfXM\",\"type\":\"video\",\"providerNameSlug\":\"youtube\",\"responsive\":true,\"className\":\"wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-embed is-type-video is-provider-youtube wp-block-embed-youtube wp-embed-aspect-16-9 wp-has-aspect-ratio\"><div class=\"wp-block-embed__wrapper\">\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KJgk84lFfXM\n</div></figure>\n<!-- /wp:embed -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>\"It's named after a song on the album called 'Special,' and I performed it on SNL this past weekend and I just feel it's an incredible song and it really summed up everything about the album. It's special in every single way because she took my time with, it's like a classic album with really thought-out songs it took three years, so It is really special to me.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Make sure you grab Lizzo's new album 'Special' dropping on July 15</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><gwmw style=\"display:none;\"></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
